  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/查看我其他的连接Applied%20Energistics%202和Cooking%20for%20Blockheads的模组-底部链接-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking Promo\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/查看我其他的连接Refined%20Storage和Cooking%20for%20Blockheads的模组-底部链接-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Promo\" width=\"800\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.meloncube.net/partners/custom-banners/f22247d3-fc0d-404f-a8b1-0ad4d5aca331.png\" alt=\"MelonCube Partner Banner\" width=\"900\" height=\"158\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/适用于Forge-1.19%20|%201.18-800000?labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft Versions Badge\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安装于-客户端%20与%20服务器-800000?labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking Install Badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是所有 Sebastrn 模组的通用库项目。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我计划为我的模组提供 Forge 和 Fabric 的支持（目前仅支持 Forge）。</p>\n<p>这个库模组将是我所有模组所需通用代码的起点（工具方法、抽象类、接口等）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此外，此模组还添加了一本指南书（基于 Patchouli 构建），以便所有我的模组玩家能够获得一些入门帮助。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我不建议任何人基于此进行开发，因为我将不提供文档，并且会根据我的模组需求对内容进行大幅更改。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>社交信息</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn&#x27;s Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn&#x27;s Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn&#x27;s Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn&#x27;s Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn&#x27;s Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"Applied Cooking Promo\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_RCLink.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Promo\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
